            "type": "game",
            "name": "Recursion Deluxe",
            "steam_appid": 425160,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/a8c42fdee1b47fbfa916eddba3cce508.avif?t=1759274644\" width=1232 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crash landing on a world inhabited by bee-like lifeforms. Stranded, our hero must unravel the rules of this uncharted planet to find their way home. Navigate a world where left is right, up is down, and you don't know where the simulation ends and you begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/3846fbafed31d06f49e75f8282d60644.poster.avif?t=1759274644\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/3846fbafed31d06f49e75f8282d60644.webm?t=1759274644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recursion Deluxe features puzzle platforming inspired by many of the great classics of the past, with carefully designed levels intended to provide an enjoyable difficulty curve.  Meticulously-crafted pixel art creates a throwback to classic 16-bit aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From its humble beginnings as 'Recursion', a Flash game released in 2012, Recursion Deluxe has been rebuilt from the ground up in a new engine. This deluxe version features new puzzle mechanics, additional biomes, remastered original content, twice as many levels, new music and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/4c722c947867df58ad3d5f33d0594f1d.poster.avif?t=1759274644\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/4c722c947867df58ad3d5f33d0594f1d.webm?t=1759274644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/4c722c947867df58ad3d5f33d0594f1d.mp4?t=1759274644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Platforming</strong> - Overcome puzzles and challenging obstacles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> - Choose between the two starting heroes and unlock more as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of Levels</strong> - Over 65 levels spanning 4 unique worlds offers hours of platforming fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> - Playable in Big Picture mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel-Perfect Rendering</strong> - No rotating pixels or sub-pixel movements here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Running Love</strong> - Deterministic gameplay and ability to track the number of frames elapsed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavily Moddable</strong> - All levels, graphics and sound files are exposed and editable. Make cool stuff! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Integration</strong> - Achievements, Cloud Saves and Trading Cards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/bd944ee3d6c15535d77f73ae5300b46b.avif?t=1759274644\" width=1232 height=96 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/a8c42fdee1b47fbfa916eddba3cce508.avif?t=1759274644\" width=1232 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crash landing on a world inhabited by bee-like lifeforms. Stranded, our hero must unravel the rules of this uncharted planet to find their way home. Navigate a world where left is right, up is down, and you don't know where the simulation ends and you begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/3846fbafed31d06f49e75f8282d60644.poster.avif?t=1759274644\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/3846fbafed31d06f49e75f8282d60644.webm?t=1759274644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recursion Deluxe features puzzle platforming inspired by many of the great classics of the past, with carefully designed levels intended to provide an enjoyable difficulty curve.  Meticulously-crafted pixel art creates a throwback to classic 16-bit aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From its humble beginnings as 'Recursion', a Flash game released in 2012, Recursion Deluxe has been rebuilt from the ground up in a new engine. This deluxe version features new puzzle mechanics, additional biomes, remastered original content, twice as many levels, new music and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/4c722c947867df58ad3d5f33d0594f1d.poster.avif?t=1759274644\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/4c722c947867df58ad3d5f33d0594f1d.webm?t=1759274644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/4c722c947867df58ad3d5f33d0594f1d.mp4?t=1759274644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Platforming</strong> - Overcome puzzles and challenging obstacles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> - Choose between the two starting heroes and unlock more as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of Levels</strong> - Over 65 levels spanning 4 unique worlds offers hours of platforming fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> - Playable in Big Picture mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel-Perfect Rendering</strong> - No rotating pixels or sub-pixel movements here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Running Love</strong> - Deterministic gameplay and ability to track the number of frames elapsed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavily Moddable</strong> - All levels, graphics and sound files are exposed and editable. Make cool stuff! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Integration</strong> - Achievements, Cloud Saves and Trading Cards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425160/extras/bd944ee3d6c15535d77f73ae5300b46b.avif?t=1759274644\" width=1232 height=96 /></span></p>",
