                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A really cute and nice game with a lots of fun and challange. I would recommend this game for everyone, who likes challanges, who isn't afraid of going for a level over and over again to beat his/her best time, or for even beat that ****ing level finally. I won't say it will be an easy game, sometimes you might want to kill every person involved in the making of this game, [b]BUT it is a game what really worth to pick up. [/b]\n\nWhats good in the game:\n[list]\n    [*]Challanging levels\n    [*]Puzzle levels\n    [*]Great enviroment and good looking levels\n    [*]Several hours of gameplay\n    [*]You can play the levels over and over again and it still not boring\n    [*]Cute potato shaped bees\n    [*]Some secret to discover\n    [*]etc.\n[/list]\n\nIf you like indie games, or platform games, or want to rest from the other games, this is a good choice.\nAnd with the developer daily streams [spoiler] well... almost daily [/spoiler] everyone could feel they were part of the game making. \n\nAfter this project the dev will probably have a lots of other project, so if you free definitely check that one out too!\n\n10/10 would have this game again!",
